      "writtenOn": "2022-11-16T21:32:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Assuming the output starts 0123 seems ok to me.\nThe issue with the prompt detection is for AP UART, \"prompt\": \"localhost login:\" is needed to detect and log in, but then it changes to \"localhost ~ # \".\nLooking for 0123 seems more robust and doesn\u0027t depend on matching any prompt exactly.",
      "parentUuid": "b488fb8f_08f07b0a",
      "revId": "4ed340be2b7604f7cdda12f611fe1068b2b17bbb",
